WEBVTT

00:06.900 --> 00:07.766
I'm ready.

00:09.733 --> 00:14.133
Okay, so welcome to Sderot. Welcome to the

00:14.666 --> 00:19.233
Israel Digital Center. Now we sit at the municipality

00:19.833 --> 00:25.333
in the control room, but we want to speak about October and

00:25.333 --> 00:35.133
before October. So my name is Gitit. I live here 10 years. I'm

00:35.133 --> 00:37.066
manager of the Israel Digital Center, and the

00:37.066 --> 00:39.100
Israel Digital Center is a place for

00:39.100 --> 00:43.000
civilians to come and speak about the true story about Israel.

00:43.100 --> 00:45.000
We have a lot of volunteers,

00:45.533 --> 00:51.600
and like me, more of my friends want to speak about the story.

00:52.333 --> 00:53.700
You know, we live

00:53.700 --> 00:57.966
with rockets for 23 years. It didn't start on October 7.

00:58.633 --> 01:05.733
And my story started four years ago, in Operation Guardian of the Walls.

01:07.733 --> 01:10.100
It's a big operation with Gaza.

01:11.233 --> 01:14.800
And I wasn't working at the Israel Digital Center.

01:14.800 --> 01:21.733
I worked another job, and I sat in my house with my daughter Adele.

01:21.733 --> 01:26.533
She was only two years old, and we heard the siren.

01:26.533 --> 01:33.233
We have 15 seconds before the rocket hits. So I heard a siren.

01:33.466 --> 01:35.500
It's like Tzeva Adom,

01:35.500 --> 01:39.400
Tzeva Adom, and I took Adele and ran to my shelter. The shelter

01:39.400 --> 01:42.733
is a safe room, and when we have rockets,

01:42.733 --> 01:48.133
we go there. And I took Adele and closed the door.

01:48.600 --> 01:52.966
And after 10 seconds, I heard a big boom.

01:54.300 --> 01:56.733
And when I opened my eyes,

01:56.733 --> 02:01.233
I saw the whole room was smashed and everything was full of smoke.

02:02.300 --> 02:06.400
We understood the rocket hit my house, and

02:09.133 --> 02:12.600
I started to scream because I had a panic attack.

02:12.600 --> 02:15.033
We didn't understand what happened, and I felt Adele

02:15.033 --> 02:17.800
wasn't breathing because everywhere was smoke.

02:17.800 --> 02:20.033
So I screamed, "Help me!"

02:20.033 --> 02:20.833
"Help me!"

02:21.466 --> 02:23.233
And after two minutes,

02:24.533 --> 02:31.800
some firefighters came and opened the door, and they took Adele and me out.

02:31.833 --> 02:35.500
They took me to the ambulance, and when I went out,

02:35.533 --> 02:41.033
I saw a big hole in the room next to my shelter,

02:42.066 --> 02:46.400
and I understood the rocket had destroyed my house.

02:47.400 --> 02:50.200
And they took me and Adele to the ambulance.

02:50.633 --> 02:52.700
But I had a big miracle. I had a big

02:52.700 --> 02:56.366
miracle because the shrapnel from the rocket came into my room,

02:56.666 --> 02:59.100
above the window and below the window,

02:59.933 --> 03:01.600
and we had a miracle.

03:02.400 --> 03:06.133
But in the next building was Ido Avigal.

03:06.400 --> 03:11.800
Ido Avigal was a child. He sat, like me, in the shelter with his family,

03:13.900 --> 03:18.533
on the bed, and the shrapnel came and killed Ido.

03:19.633 --> 03:24.700
Ido was only a five-year-old child.

03:28.266 --> 03:31.166
After this, um...

03:32.600 --> 03:36.033
we had PTSD. It's post-traumatic,

03:37.500 --> 03:38.300
and...

03:41.100 --> 03:45.633
and we thought, what can we do? Because we have trauma.

03:46.233 --> 03:49.166
And we started therapy.

03:52.466 --> 03:59.600
We went to the psychologist, and after the therapy she told me,

03:59.900 --> 04:01.433
"I have two rules

04:01.433 --> 04:07.100
if you want to stay in Sderot," because we wanted to change houses.

04:08.466 --> 04:09.733
We wanted to change houses.

04:09.733 --> 04:12.933
We didn't want to change the city and the community,

04:12.933 --> 04:15.400
because we feel good in this community.

04:17.100 --> 04:18.666
She said, "I have two rules.

04:18.666 --> 04:21.033
One rule: when you have a siren,

04:21.066 --> 04:25.733
don't be alone. And the second rule: you need to work with this."

04:26.066 --> 04:30.400
So I started to work with a lot of delegations like you, from the world.

04:31.433 --> 04:36.633
We met a lot of delegations before October 7.

04:38.200 --> 04:45.300
And we changed houses. We built a big villa with two shelters, not one.

04:46.033 --> 04:48.200
Nobody takes my control again.

04:50.266 --> 04:57.066
On the morning of October 7, we heard a lot of sirens, and we keep Shabbat all day.

04:57.066 --> 05:00.766
We don't open the mobile or the television,

05:01.933 --> 05:04.566
and we felt it was something different.

05:04.733 --> 05:07.533
But we said, okay, we live like this.

05:07.533 --> 05:10.833
We know what this is. We have a shelter and everything.

05:10.833 --> 05:11.733
It's okay.

05:12.700 --> 05:17.400
So time went by and the sirens didn't stop,

05:17.700 --> 05:21.033
and we said, okay, something is different.

05:21.033 --> 05:24.100
And we saw Adele, she didn't feel good,

05:24.700 --> 05:26.733
and I remembered what the psychologist said:

05:26.733 --> 05:28.500
if you have a siren, don't be alone.

05:28.500 --> 05:31.800
Be with more people. So we said, okay,

05:31.800 --> 05:35.500
I have a friend. She lives only one minute from my house.

05:36.066 --> 05:38.533
We'll take Adele and be with more people.

05:40.300 --> 05:41.100
So...

05:42.300 --> 05:43.666
We took the stroller.

05:43.666 --> 05:50.100
We started walking and we heard a lot of shooting, and we said,

05:51.100 --> 05:54.333
"Wow, IDF is so close. Amazing."

05:54.833 --> 05:56.833
We understood nothing.

06:00.333 --> 06:03.833
So everywhere in Sderot, when you go out into the street,

06:03.833 --> 06:04.933
all the doors are open,

06:04.933 --> 06:08.033
because if you need to go to a shelter, if you need a safe room,

06:08.033 --> 06:10.100
you can open the door and run to the shelter.

06:11.233 --> 06:15.100
So we went into the street. It's only one minute walking.

06:15.100 --> 06:17.000
We got to my friend's. We knocked on the door.

06:17.033 --> 06:20.233
Nobody answered. We knocked on the door and said, "Hello?

06:20.466 --> 06:22.000
Why did you lock the door?

06:22.800 --> 06:24.300
We have sirens."

06:24.833 --> 06:31.033
So my friend opened the door and told me, "What are you doing outside?

06:31.633 --> 06:34.366
We have a lot of terrorists all over the city."

06:34.600 --> 06:37.600
So I said, "What terrorists?"

06:38.633 --> 06:40.033
I understood nothing.

06:41.133 --> 06:44.600
So I got to my friend and we went to the shelter,

06:44.600 --> 06:47.566
and I felt bad because I took Adele outside again.

06:48.233 --> 06:55.400
I thought, "What did I do?" And my friend opened her mobile, and

06:55.400 --> 06:57.933
we started to see videos from Sderot,

06:57.933 --> 07:00.633
and we saw videos from the police station,

07:01.300 --> 07:03.233
a truck with terrorists.

07:03.666 --> 07:06.966
You need to remember, the terrorists were shooting the electricity,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.933
the terrorists were shooting the Wi-Fi,

07:08.933 --> 07:10.566
the terrorists were shooting the connection.

07:10.866 --> 07:13.033
If you got a message, it took a lot of time.

07:13.033 --> 07:15.500
When you saw the message, you had a delay.

07:16.333 --> 07:19.600
So we saw some videos from the police station

07:19.700 --> 07:23.100
and the truck on the road,

07:23.100 --> 07:24.400
and we said, okay,

07:24.533 --> 07:26.933
how many terrorists came to Sderot?

07:26.933 --> 07:28.966
Ten maximum, okay.

07:30.100 --> 07:31.933
We sat in the shelter and everything

07:31.933 --> 07:36.833
was okay. So the hours went by, and it was evening,

07:38.133 --> 07:39.833
and we said, okay,

07:39.833 --> 07:42.600
we'll go back home. It's only one minute walking.

07:42.600 --> 07:45.766
We'll go back home, sit in my shelter, and go to sleep.

07:47.266 --> 07:52.166
So we took Adele, we took the stroller, and we started walking to my house.

07:53.266 --> 07:55.333
And before we got to the house,

07:55.333 --> 07:58.700
we heard a siren. We took Adele and ran to the shelter.

07:58.700 --> 08:01.400
So before I closed the shelter door,

08:01.733 --> 08:04.633
I saw some people trying to open my house door.

08:07.400 --> 08:08.433
After this,

08:09.000 --> 08:10.566
I understood the reality.

08:11.800 --> 08:13.600
I crawled to the kitchen.

08:14.133 --> 08:15.600
I took a knife.

08:16.233 --> 08:22.733
I came back to my shelter. I sat on the floor without food,

08:23.033 --> 08:25.200
without a toilet, without water,

08:25.400 --> 08:28.166
without anything, on the floor,

08:28.466 --> 08:29.400
for 10 hours.

08:30.466 --> 08:32.933
And all the time I heard shooting outside.

08:33.233 --> 08:34.900
And Adele asked me all the time,

08:34.900 --> 08:35.833
"Mommy, what's happening?

08:35.833 --> 08:36.933
What's happening?" I said, "Adele,

08:36.933 --> 08:38.900
please don't speak, because I'm afraid

08:38.900 --> 08:41.366
some people are here." And she didn't stop,

08:41.533 --> 08:42.900
and she asked me again and again,

08:42.900 --> 08:43.666
"Mommy, what's happening?

08:43.666 --> 08:44.700
Mommy, what's happening?"

08:44.700 --> 08:47.500
I covered her mouth with my hand.

08:52.733 --> 08:56.800
You know, I grew up with stories about the Holocaust.

08:57.266 --> 08:59.200
My grandma, she was there.

09:02.866 --> 09:05.600
At this time, I felt like the Holocaust,

09:06.300 --> 09:10.733
because I sat in my house on the floor,

09:11.066 --> 09:15.100
and some people came and tried to murder me because I'm Jewish.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.333
I felt very bad.

09:20.033 --> 09:22.000
I had a panic attack again,

09:25.300 --> 09:30.333
and I called my friend. He's a commando in the army.

09:33.000 --> 09:36.400
And I told him, "I have a panic attack.

09:36.400 --> 09:38.500
You need to come and take my family out."

09:38.933 --> 09:41.200
And my friend told me, "I cannot come.

09:41.400 --> 09:43.466
We have terrorists all over the city."

09:43.466 --> 09:44.600
I said, "I don't care.

09:44.933 --> 09:46.966
You need to come and take me now,"

09:48.200 --> 09:50.966
because all the time I felt it was happening again,

09:52.533 --> 09:54.133
and I felt hopeless.

09:55.333 --> 10:01.833
Hopeless. What can I do with a knife if some people come with guns?

10:04.866 --> 10:09.133
And my friend came after three hours and took my family out.

10:10.333 --> 10:12.200
And when my family went out,

10:12.533 --> 10:14.933
my family told me, "You see all over—

10:14.933 --> 10:17.333
all over the place—bodies.

10:18.000 --> 10:18.800
Children,

10:19.533 --> 10:21.800
babies, old people,

10:23.000 --> 10:24.733
young people, men,

10:24.733 --> 10:28.500
women, everything. Like a big apocalypse."

10:30.333 --> 10:32.466
But I stayed here. I stayed here

10:32.466 --> 10:35.933
because this is the time to speak about the true story about Israel.

10:37.033 --> 10:43.533
We opened the control room. We met 6,000 members of the press from around the world

10:43.533 --> 10:46.200
who came to speak about the true story about Israel.

10:46.433 --> 10:49.433
We made a lot of press conferences.

10:52.400 --> 10:57.600
And now I speak about my friend. He's a spokesman for ZAKA,

10:59.000 --> 10:59.800
and...

11:02.533 --> 11:06.233
and it's tough, but the world needs to know the truth.

11:08.800 --> 11:12.500
My friend from ZAKA—ZAKA is an organization that works with bodies.

11:12.500 --> 11:17.166
When everything happened, ZAKA took the bodies and took them to the fridge.

11:18.866 --> 11:23.533
So ZAKA told me about the Nova Festival.

11:24.200 --> 11:26.700
When ZAKA went to the Nova Festival,

11:29.733 --> 11:35.100
you found a lot of severed genitalia all over the place,

11:35.733 --> 11:37.100
on the trees.

11:38.200 --> 11:42.966
He told me about a young girl, a beautiful young girl.

11:45.266 --> 11:49.433
You see the body and you think maybe she's alive.

11:49.500 --> 11:53.400
You come to try to help, and all the people say, "No,

11:53.400 --> 11:53.733
no, no,

11:53.733 --> 11:54.633
no, no, no."

11:56.000 --> 11:57.100
You know why?

11:59.066 --> 12:01.833
Because the terrorists had taken an IED and put it on the body,

12:01.933 --> 12:02.933
the woman's body,

12:03.633 --> 12:05.733
and they were afraid it would explode.

12:08.266 --> 12:11.233
He told me about a young girl from the kibbutz.

12:12.633 --> 12:14.400
He opened the door, the shelter door,

12:14.400 --> 12:19.200
and he saw a young girl without clothes. She was only 12 years old.

12:22.200 --> 12:25.600
And when the one monster finished, he shot her in the head.

12:27.133 --> 12:32.333
And it's only two stories. We don't have surviving women and men who were raped.

12:32.933 --> 12:35.533
We don't have surviving children who were raped. We don't have...

12:38.300 --> 12:41.133
And you know why I told you all these stories,

12:41.200 --> 12:44.100
and I met you, and I met a lot of delegations?

12:44.900 --> 12:46.733
Because now it's your job.

12:47.733 --> 12:50.000
Your job. All the people see.

12:51.533 --> 12:53.133
Now it's your mission.

12:54.700 --> 12:58.200
You need to speak about the true story about Israel,

12:58.433 --> 13:01.033
because we have a lot of men and women

13:02.266 --> 13:04.800
murdered who will never speak again.

13:05.066 --> 13:07.266
And if we have the power to be the voice

13:07.266 --> 13:08.966
and to speak about the true story,

13:09.266 --> 13:13.133
now it's your job, and you speak about this.

13:15.666 --> 13:18.833
And I want to say before I finish:

13:20.733 --> 13:25.900
we stand strong, we stand with Israel, because Am Yisrael Chai.

13:26.633 --> 13:29.500
And next year, when you come here,

13:30.533 --> 13:32.400
we'll make a big party,

13:33.833 --> 13:36.966
because the terrorists will not win.

13:38.100 --> 13:42.900
And today we have 39,000 people living in Sderot.

13:42.900 --> 13:45.600
Next year, b'ezrat Hashem,

13:45.633 --> 13:51.400
70,000 people. Because never again.

13:52.833 --> 13:53.633
Thank you.

14:04.466 --> 14:08.533
And how many delegations have you spoken to?

14:09.233 --> 14:14.433
And did you get any reactions afterward, once they had left?

14:14.433 --> 14:16.533
Yeah, we are here. Yes.

14:16.833 --> 14:18.900
Do you hear anything about what they do afterward?

14:19.400 --> 14:21.033
So because when you are talking—

14:21.033 --> 14:23.200
Follow-up afterward, yes.

14:24.033 --> 14:26.000
Yes, some press—

14:26.600 --> 14:27.500
no, not some,

14:27.500 --> 14:31.933
a lot of press, like you, make a

14:34.000 --> 14:36.166
show, make a program,

14:36.233 --> 14:38.966
make a newspaper,

14:39.533 --> 14:40.733
and it's very helpful.

14:40.733 --> 14:45.133
A lot of people on social media, when we send it, say,

14:45.600 --> 14:46.833
"Oh, sorry.

14:46.833 --> 14:49.100
Now I believe you. I believe you,

14:49.100 --> 14:51.500
because before I thought you

14:51.533 --> 14:54.433
were committing genocide and killing babies,

14:54.433 --> 14:56.100
and now I understand everything."

14:56.433 --> 14:58.900
It's very helpful. It's very helpful.

14:59.666 --> 15:03.100
And you know, but it's a program,

15:03.100 --> 15:08.200
it's a newspaper. We need something stronger, because

15:09.633 --> 15:11.400
this is the big question.

15:11.933 --> 15:15.733
And I think we need to speak about this

15:15.733 --> 15:21.100
and not stop. If you come here and hear my story and you send this, okay,

15:21.133 --> 15:22.733
but we have a community.

15:23.500 --> 15:29.033
The name is Israel Digital Center, and you can help us. You know,

15:29.033 --> 15:31.200
if something happened yesterday,

15:31.200 --> 15:35.733
we send it to the community, and the community sends it to people from Germany,

15:35.733 --> 15:38.200
from the world. It's very helpful.

15:39.300 --> 15:45.933
We need to be more connected, because it's not

15:46.700 --> 15:52.533
boom and finished. You come here, and after, if you have an idea,

15:52.833 --> 15:55.633
if you want to...

15:56.333 --> 15:58.400
or...

15:59.666 --> 16:05.300
If we post something on social media,

16:05.300 --> 16:06.200
we send it to you,

16:06.333 --> 16:10.900
and it's very helpful. Because if we are together, we can be strong,

16:11.133 --> 16:13.333
because you have followers, and you have followers,

16:13.333 --> 16:15.233
and you have followers, and you have followers,

16:15.300 --> 16:18.766
and it's very helpful because it's powerful today.

16:18.833 --> 16:20.933
Everything happens on social media.

16:20.933 --> 16:22.000
You have Facebook,

16:22.000 --> 16:28.966
TikTok, and Instagram. It's strong. You know, those who came to kill,

16:30.266 --> 16:32.766
the terrorists, have social media too,

16:32.933 --> 16:37.266
and they said, "Israel is killing..." and everything, blah blah,

16:37.266 --> 16:41.000
blah blah. And all the people, all the terrorists, came here—

16:41.633 --> 16:45.333
6,000 on October 7.

16:45.933 --> 16:49.166
6,000 terrorists and civilians.

16:50.300 --> 16:54.766
And the terrorists took GoPros and sent to social media

16:55.600 --> 16:57.566
how the terrorists killed.

16:59.100 --> 16:59.933
And after,

17:01.233 --> 17:04.566
we had a lot of videos on Telegram,

17:04.700 --> 17:07.233
and the terrorists understood it's crazy.

17:08.266 --> 17:12.000
They deleted it because they understood it's crazy.

17:13.633 --> 17:16.300
But this is everything.

17:16.700 --> 17:20.966
You have everything here, and this is the power to win.

17:21.600 --> 17:27.700
We need to do more stuff, but this is powerful for good and for bad,

17:28.700 --> 17:29.500
I think.

17:33.266 --> 17:38.433
Yeah, so I think it's so impressive how you're handling all this.

17:38.433 --> 17:43.700
And, you know, you're two years in now, and during those two years,

17:43.700 --> 17:47.300
what were the moments that gave you the strength?

17:47.300 --> 17:49.733
And the first moments where you were thinking, okay,

17:49.733 --> 17:55.066
I can somehow—maybe not recover from this—

17:55.066 --> 17:59.100
but I can handle it, and I can somehow, yeah,

17:59.100 --> 18:00.933
get back to my strength.

18:01.866 --> 18:04.833
If I understand... I think about your question.

18:05.066 --> 18:06.500
If not, tell me. It's not the answer.

18:10.300 --> 18:13.600
Sometimes I feel like this.

18:13.600 --> 18:20.833
Sometimes I feel like this, and I fall. Sometimes I have panic attacks.

18:22.266 --> 18:26.833
It's good because I get skinny because I don't eat, but it's not funny.

18:26.866 --> 18:32.133
I feel bad. I feel all the time, I think maybe I need to stop.

18:32.833 --> 18:37.300
Maybe I speak about animals, good energy...

18:37.300 --> 18:40.933
And I cannot, because it's my...

18:42.066 --> 18:50.933
my blood, and I feel if I have the voice to speak for people,

18:51.333 --> 18:51.800
you know...

18:51.800 --> 18:57.800
A lot of people survived, but you know, I have a friend, Yarden Bibas.

18:59.233 --> 19:01.766
Yarden is the last

19:03.500 --> 19:06.000
of the family, and Yarden

19:06.133 --> 19:11.033
doesn't like to speak with the... he doesn't like... he's not that person.

19:11.233 --> 19:14.800
But in life, you need to speak.

19:14.800 --> 19:15.866
So I said, okay,

19:15.866 --> 19:19.700
don't speak. Tell me your story, and I'll speak about your story.

19:19.700 --> 19:21.533
But it's crazy.

19:22.066 --> 19:26.200
I pay for this. I pay—sometimes I feel very bad.

19:26.633 --> 19:28.400
Sometimes my group falls...

19:29.266 --> 19:30.166
my group...

19:30.800 --> 19:34.066
because you see the disaster videos, and we see all the videos,

19:34.066 --> 19:35.733
and we speak about this.

19:36.466 --> 19:40.166
It's crazy, but you know, my psychologist told me—

19:42.600 --> 19:47.033
Can—yeah, the security guy, he comes here, yeah.

19:47.300 --> 19:48.100
Good.

19:48.500 --> 19:49.300
So...

19:49.800 --> 19:53.300
But I want to say, my psychologist told me,

19:53.300 --> 19:56.100
if you speak about this again and again and again,

19:56.733 --> 20:01.533
it's better. Little by little, you can feel better.

20:02.266 --> 20:08.900
But all the time it changes. I feel all the time like this, understand?

20:09.466 --> 20:10.266
Yes.

20:10.800 --> 20:11.600
Thank you.

20:14.700 --> 20:17.500
How is your daughter doing?

20:18.566 --> 20:21.366
Oh, a lot of groups ask me.

20:22.600 --> 20:28.866
So Adele now, she's five years old—five, five and a half—and

20:31.800 --> 20:33.166
she's different from me.

20:33.566 --> 20:36.700
You see, when you're in the Gaza envelope, you hear the bombs.

20:36.700 --> 20:42.366
It's IDF, but she asks me sometimes when she hears a bomb,

20:42.766 --> 20:43.566
"Mommy,

20:44.100 --> 20:48.200
are the terrorists coming to kill me again?"

20:49.400 --> 20:51.533
And I look in her eyes and I say—

20:53.466 --> 20:56.400
I breathe, and I say, "Don't worry.

20:56.400 --> 21:01.600
Everything is under control." And I'm a liar, because I don't feel control.

21:01.666 --> 21:05.066
I don't know what's happening, and my heart breaks again and again.

21:06.200 --> 21:10.800
And she asks me, "What do the terrorists look like?"

21:11.966 --> 21:15.933
She thinks like a dinosaur or like a monster, and I say,

21:16.833 --> 21:18.266
"Adele, my baby,

21:18.633 --> 21:21.700
it's like me and like you." And she doesn't understand.

21:21.900 --> 21:29.300
She doesn't need to feel this, but we take her to animal therapy.

21:29.466 --> 21:35.533
It's very helpful. When she holds an animal, she feels control, and

21:36.833 --> 21:39.400
when we have sirens—we have a lot of sirens—

21:39.400 --> 21:41.633
afterward we dance in the shelter.

21:41.633 --> 21:42.500
We try.

21:43.433 --> 21:44.866
Yeah, it's a good way.

21:45.900 --> 21:46.700
Yeah.

21:47.066 --> 21:50.566
But you know Ido—remember Ido?

21:50.566 --> 21:55.266
Ido Avigal had a dance for when you go to the shelter,

21:56.500 --> 21:59.533
and Ido was very afraid of the rockets,

21:59.800 --> 22:02.966
and all the time he had problems sleeping.

22:04.900 --> 22:10.633
And it's bad because he tried to feel resilience,

22:10.633 --> 22:12.900
and he sat in the shelter with the

22:13.000 --> 22:14.766
window closed,

22:15.966 --> 22:19.033
but the shrapnel came and killed him.

22:19.366 --> 22:23.400
Children from the Gaza envelope and Sderot

22:23.400 --> 22:26.900
grow up early. You see the Swissa family.

22:26.900 --> 22:31.500
She said, "I have a baby, she's only six years old, and she saw everything."

22:31.766 --> 22:37.700
All the children from here grow up early because this is life.

22:37.800 --> 22:40.600
And we have the story about Abigail.

22:40.666 --> 22:45.300
She was kidnapped. She was only three years old, and she saw everything.

22:45.300 --> 22:50.300
She saw her mother and father murdered. And we have babies, 10 months,

22:51.433 --> 22:52.566
the twins.

22:54.900 --> 22:56.933
And when the soldiers came to help,

22:56.966 --> 23:02.900
they saw the mother and father murdered, and the babies sleeping like this,

23:04.800 --> 23:10.000
not crying, 10 hours without food, without anything.

23:11.233 --> 23:16.266
You don't need to speak. After you see this, you feel this, and...

23:20.366 --> 23:24.766
The terrorists don't care about children,

23:26.066 --> 23:29.300
old people. They take a baby and cut the head.

23:29.700 --> 23:30.933
It doesn't matter.

23:31.566 --> 23:38.466
They take everyone. Ariel and Kfir, only nine months and four years old.

23:40.466 --> 23:41.600
How can you live?

23:42.266 --> 23:45.800
I asked Yarden, "How can you live after this?"

23:46.233 --> 23:48.266
And I see the eyes, and I understand

23:48.266 --> 23:51.066
everything. And it doesn't stop.

23:52.066 --> 23:57.900
The terrorists take the children and use them like human shields,

23:58.466 --> 23:59.966
and we don't know what to do.

24:01.033 --> 24:02.266
If it's a soldier—

24:02.266 --> 24:07.533
a soldier, it's tough, but it's okay. But if you take civilians,

24:07.866 --> 24:10.300
it's a problem. You don't have a fight.

24:10.900 --> 24:12.533
It's not the same power.

24:15.066 --> 24:23.566
But I say to Adele, "Am Yisrael Chai. It's tough. Sometimes Mommy feels bad,

24:23.800 --> 24:27.200
sometimes you feel bad, but we need to win."

24:28.433 --> 24:32.800
This is the way. And after, I go to cry and I come back.

24:32.800 --> 24:34.300
But it's like this.

24:37.600 --> 24:39.900
I take it you'll come again.

24:41.766 --> 24:42.566
Thank you.

24:43.100 --> 24:47.366
Yeah, and do you know any people—

24:47.833 --> 24:53.100
hostages who came back from the Gaza Strip?

24:53.100 --> 24:55.900
Are there people you know, maybe from here?

24:56.866 --> 25:01.066
From here, we had only one. His name is Michel.

25:03.633 --> 25:05.266
Yeah, after a lot of time.

25:07.033 --> 25:10.800
No, no, from Sderot we had only one, and his body came back.

25:11.166 --> 25:12.166
Came back, you know—

25:12.166 --> 25:16.233
murdered, and after five months,

25:16.233 --> 25:17.266
something like this.

25:18.200 --> 25:21.266
And now we don't have anyone from there.

25:21.266 --> 25:29.900
We have 48 hostages from all the Gaza envelope and Nova. Nova—

25:29.900 --> 25:32.800
a lot of people came from all Israel.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.533
And only 20 are alive.

25:36.866 --> 25:43.333
We think only 20 are alive, and all the others are bodies.

25:45.000 --> 25:49.400
And we have one woman, she's murdered,

25:51.833 --> 25:55.700
and I said, we know a little bit of stories about the

25:55.700 --> 25:57.933
sexual violence there against women.

25:59.233 --> 26:03.133
You know, it's only two years after, and the war doesn't stop.

26:03.433 --> 26:07.233
We don't stop and check everything all the time.

26:07.233 --> 26:09.600
We need to fight and we need to survive.

26:11.300 --> 26:18.500
But we know when everything stops... Today we have a big meeting. We pray,

26:18.600 --> 26:20.200
but I don't believe.

26:20.966 --> 26:25.800
I think we come back to Gaza, and we need to close the story,

26:26.366 --> 26:30.533
because the terrorists don't give back the hostages,

26:32.466 --> 26:33.600
and it's a problem,

26:35.400 --> 26:41.066
because some are soldiers, but some are civilians, like me, like you.

26:48.100 --> 26:52.333
What was your impression of Gaza before October 7?

26:52.333 --> 26:54.933
Did you have any connections, friends, you know?

26:57.833 --> 27:02.233
All the people who came here on October 7 worked here, okay?

27:02.233 --> 27:04.933
And in the kibbutzim too, we...

27:04.933 --> 27:08.833
I remember one story about a magnet on the fridge,

27:09.300 --> 27:11.433
with the family with the terrorist,

27:11.933 --> 27:16.166
and this guy came to kill the family. So we had connections.

27:16.366 --> 27:23.800
We worked together. A lot of houses were built by people from Gaza.

27:25.433 --> 27:30.166
But we don't believe anymore, because the people—

27:30.566 --> 27:32.933
the people from Gaza who built the houses—

27:32.966 --> 27:38.200
came back after and murdered the people. So we gave work,

27:38.233 --> 27:40.966
we had connections, we believed in peace,

27:42.333 --> 27:45.833
but everything changed. Because, you know,

27:45.833 --> 27:49.466
20 years ago, you could go to Gaza and eat,

27:50.133 --> 27:52.733
you had restaurants, you had a lot of places.

27:52.833 --> 27:54.933
But after October 7,

27:56.066 --> 27:59.600
we don't believe. All the people who came here, they were cheating.

27:59.766 --> 28:02.066
The terrorists knew how many dogs you had,

28:02.066 --> 28:03.933
how many people lived in this house.

28:04.133 --> 28:05.966
The terrorists took pictures of everything.

28:06.333 --> 28:10.700
So it didn't work. We believed it worked,

28:10.700 --> 28:12.333
but after October 7,

28:13.500 --> 28:14.533
everything changed.

28:15.133 --> 28:17.766
I believed, and a lot of people believed like me,

28:17.866 --> 28:19.533
because in the kibbutzim,

28:19.533 --> 28:22.433
you had very good connections with people.

28:22.433 --> 28:27.433
They came to eat in your house, and it was like family, and family, and...

28:28.966 --> 28:31.233
This guy came and murdered the family.

28:32.300 --> 28:33.400
It's tough.

28:41.400 --> 28:58.233
Will there be peace after October 7?

29:05.466 --> 29:07.100
It's a very sad question,

29:08.533 --> 29:09.333
and...

29:11.800 --> 29:14.500
and I believe maybe in the future.

29:15.333 --> 29:19.233
But I told you yesterday, my friend—

29:19.233 --> 29:21.466
she was kidnapped, and the group

29:21.733 --> 29:24.566
that took her to Gaza

29:24.566 --> 29:28.466
were civilians, not Hamas, not Islamic Jihad.

29:29.933 --> 29:31.466
And my friend, she came back.

29:31.466 --> 29:33.633
She'd been kidnapped, and she said,

29:34.166 --> 29:37.466
"I'm a woman." And the wife of

29:38.066 --> 29:41.066
the civilian from Gaza—the woman—

29:41.533 --> 29:42.333
she said,

29:42.666 --> 29:47.966
"I need something private, for women," and she said to the terrorist,

29:48.133 --> 29:51.100
"She wants something." Nobody helped her.

29:51.800 --> 29:52.600
and...

29:55.066 --> 29:57.566
I don't know. It's...

29:57.966 --> 30:00.500
It's tough to trust again.

30:01.366 --> 30:05.133
We don't believe. Before, we thought, okay,

30:05.133 --> 30:06.833
maybe. And after—

30:09.333 --> 30:10.133
no.

30:10.366 --> 30:17.900
6,000 people came here to kill, not only terrorists, and it's a problem.

30:22.733 --> 30:26.900
After two years, when you think about your life at the moment,

30:27.166 --> 30:37.000
what makes you happy?

30:45.266 --> 30:46.766
To be with my family.

30:48.333 --> 30:49.600
And I... I...

30:49.600 --> 30:51.933
I'm happy when I feel control,

30:52.333 --> 30:53.966
control—my family,

30:55.233 --> 30:58.933
and I'm happy when I feel safe, because

31:01.166 --> 31:06.733
something broke, and sometimes it's stronger,

31:06.766 --> 31:11.566
sometimes it's less, and all the time it changes.

31:12.433 --> 31:15.666
And I feel happy when my family feels good.

31:16.433 --> 31:17.666
I feel happy.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.466
If we feel hopeless again,

31:21.666 --> 31:22.733
hopeless,

31:24.066 --> 31:25.533
I cannot anymore.

31:26.433 --> 31:30.833
I need the control, because when you feel hopeless,

31:32.400 --> 31:35.500
and you feel you have only a knife,

31:35.533 --> 31:39.900
and some people come to murder you because you're Jewish,

31:41.233 --> 31:45.233
and you're not—you're not a soldier,

31:45.333 --> 31:47.733
you don't want to fight,

31:48.600 --> 31:53.366
you want to live, and some people come and try to murder you,

31:55.533 --> 31:57.533
I need my control, yeah.

31:58.266 --> 32:00.133
I need to feel the control.

32:00.333 --> 32:03.300
Not control over people—control over myself.

32:04.600 --> 32:08.200
And I want to feel safe when I go into the street.

32:08.200 --> 32:11.633
You know, all the time I drive and I say,

32:12.333 --> 32:14.233
okay, I have 15 seconds.

32:14.233 --> 32:17.933
If we have a siren now, what can I do?

32:17.933 --> 32:19.700
I stop, I take Adele,

32:19.700 --> 32:23.733
I go, I run. All the time, you're ready for something.

32:26.500 --> 32:28.933
And it's tough. This is PTSD.

32:29.100 --> 32:31.766
Post-traumatic. It's like this. So...

32:33.633 --> 32:39.666
All the time I work with a psychologist, I work with myself,

32:39.666 --> 32:41.566
and I believe in God.

32:42.066 --> 32:45.500
I try all the time to say, "What needs to happen

32:45.500 --> 32:46.566
will happen."

32:47.133 --> 32:50.033
Because if all the time I need to feel control,

32:50.666 --> 32:53.833
I cannot live. All the time I...

32:53.833 --> 32:55.133
I need to...

33:00.500 --> 33:01.533
You understand?

33:02.333 --> 33:06.466
You want quiet. You want to live in peace,

33:06.933 --> 33:12.933
a good life, good energy, without the rockets, without everything,

33:13.200 --> 33:17.333
because you need to feel safe.

33:19.466 --> 33:21.366
And now it's not like this,

33:22.733 --> 33:27.900
but we pray that in the future maybe something will happen.
